# Shared repository build-context configuration (spec 0031 §4). The Core
# image builds with the repository root as context (see
# products/ariadne/deploy/compose.yaml); the whitelist follows the relocated
# Core member and its product-owned Dockerfile.
**
!products
!products/ariadne
!products/ariadne/deploy
!products/ariadne/deploy/Dockerfile
!products/ariadne/packages
!products/ariadne/packages/ariadne-data
!products/ariadne/packages/ariadne-data/pyproject.toml
!products/ariadne/packages/ariadne-data/README.md
!products/ariadne/packages/ariadne-data/src
!products/ariadne/packages/ariadne-data/src/ariadne
!products/ariadne/packages/ariadne-data/src/ariadne/*.py
!products/ariadne/packages/ariadne-data/src/ariadne/skill_assets
!products/ariadne/packages/ariadne-data/src/ariadne/skill_assets/SKILL.md
!products/ariadne/packages/ariadne-data/src/ariadne/skill_assets/references
!products/ariadne/packages/ariadne-data/src/ariadne/skill_assets/references/*.md
